SUMMARY:Remix: C Paul Jennewein
LOCATION:120 W Gasparilla Plaza Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, Nov 5  6:009:00 PM Ages 18  Beginner Level Remix is
  a series of make-and-take art workshops for adults inspired by the Museum
 s current exhibitions with a new project every month. This months project 
 will be inspired by our C. Paul Jennewein Exhibition (https:tampamuseum.or
 gc-paul-jennewein). Focusing on easy\, small landscape paintings of the be
 autiful Tampa Area in the evening. Workshops are designed to be enjoyed by
  participants of any skill level\, and all materials are provided. \n\nPer
 malink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193601
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193601
