SUMMARY:Soldier039\\\;s Lens 2026 Opening Reception
LOCATION:1630 East 7th Avenue Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:For the second year in a row\, we asked the community to join 
 us in honoring the sacrifice\, connection\, and strength of our service me
 mbers. Join us for the opening reception of A Soldiers Lens\, an evocative
  photography exhibition capturing the raw human experiences of military li
 fe through the eyes of those who served and their families. \n\nPermalink:
  https://www.tampa.gov/node/194766
