SUMMARY:The GayMazing Race
LOCATION:1920 E 7th Ave Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:Were taking over Historic Ybor City on Sunday\, Nov 8th for an
  adventure built for teams of two Solve clues\, complete challenges\, disc
 over local businesses\, and collect passport stamps. 95 per team  47.50 pe
 r person. You do not need to be an athlete to compete. You just need a tea
 mmate\, a sense of adventure\, and a willingness to have some fun. What Yo
 ur Registration Includes: GayMazing Drawstring Bag created by a local quee
 r small business Oh Sht Kit in case of emergencies (swag bag) Race Day Hos
 ts Chris and Esme from Big Gay Radio Show Clues and challenges crafted by 
 local business and volunteers to give you 2-3 hours of adventure Official 
 Race Passport created by a local queer artist and so much more! Race Day: 
 Racers will check in at 1920 Ybor before heading next door to 7th and Grov
 e for the starting line. Wave 1: 9:30am Wave 2: 10am Most teams should com
 plete the course in approximately 2-3 hours... assuming you dont get lost.
  Bring: Fully Charged Phone Refillable Water Bottle Comfortable Shoes Your
  Most Trustworthy Teammate NOT RACING? COME ANYWAY AND INVITE EVERYONE! Ra
 ce HQ: Project No Labels will be hosting our FREE FAMILY FRIENDLY VENDOR V
 ILLAGE highlighting local businesses\, community activities\, watch the ra
 ce LIVE\, and a Mini GayMazing Race for the kids. The Finish Line: After t
 he race\, celebrate at 7th  Grove with a live DJ! Optional Brunch Buffer: 
 45 per person\, including one mimosa or mocktail (pay at the restaurant on
  race day. Questions Email: gaymazingteamgmail.com (mailto:gaymazingteamgm
 ail.com) \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196986
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196986
END:VEVENT
