SUMMARY:From Barrel to Table: Flor de Caa Tasting Dinner
LOCATION:505 Water Street Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us on November 8th\, 2026 for an elevated evening celebra
 ting the craft and character of Flor de Caa rum. This curated tasting dinn
 er invites guests to explore the depth and versatility of one of Nicaragua
 s most iconic rums through a thoughtfully crafted progression of cocktails
 \, tastings\, and culinary pairings. Well be joined by Flor de Caa Brand A
 mbassador Luis Baez\, who travels the world sharing the story\, heritage\,
  and craftsmanship of Flor de Caa with rum enthusiasts. The evening will f
 eature an Aged Old Fashioned\, a selection of Flor de Caa expressions\, an
 d a decadent cocktail to close the night\, all complemented by a menu spec
 ially created by our chef to bring out the unique character of each pour. 
 An evening of aged rum\, exceptional cuisine\, and a few surprises along t
 he way. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197226
