SUMMARY:Brunch With The Newmans
LOCATION:2701 N. 16th St. Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:Tampa is welcoming cigar lovers from near and far\, and were o
 pening our doors for a special Saturday at El Reloj! Join us on December 5
  to explore our historic cigar factory\, discover more than 130 years of c
 igarmaking tradition\, and enjoy a day of cigars\, history\, and good comp
 any. Whether youre joining us for brunch\, booking a factory tour or cigar
  rolling class\, or simply stopping by to enjoy the atmosphere\, there are
  plenty of ways to spend your Saturday with us. Advance reservations are r
 equired for brunch and cigar experiences. No reservations? No problem! Our
  Factory Store and Cigar Museum will be open from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. for gue
 sts to shop and explore at their own pace. Across the street\, Cigar Worke
 rs Park will be open for visitors to relax with a cigar and enjoy a cockta
 il or other beverage from our outdoor bar\, all in the shadow of El Relojs
  historic clock tower. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197666
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197666
END:VEVENT
