SUMMARY:Formidable! AZNAVOUR - Direct from Paris\, the story of a legend
LOCATION:1010 N Macinnes Pl Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Step into the golden world of post-war Paris and experience th
 e unforgettable story of one of the greatest chanson artists of all time  
 Charles Aznavour. FORMIDABLE! AZNAVOUR is a moving and vibrant theatrical-
 musical journey through the life\, music\, passion\, and extraordinary int
 ernational career of the legendary performer whose songs touched millions 
 around the world. Starring internationally acclaimed performer Jules Griso
 n\, this powerful production brings Aznavours timeless classics back to li
 fe with elegance\, emotion\, and authenticity. Once dismissed by critics f
 or having an inaudible voice and an unremarkable physique\, Aznavour prove
 d them all wrong. Through talent\, perseverance\, and undeniable charisma\
 , he rose to become one of the most beloved voices in music history. He pe
 rformed to sold-out audiences around the world\, including the United Stat
 es\, and became known as Frances Frank Sinatra. Author of more than 800 so
 ngs\, Aznavour was a global icon whose music crossed generations and borde
 rs. His songs were performed by some of the greatest artists of all time\,
  including Ray Charles\, Fred Astaire\, Shirley Bassey\, Elvis Costello\, 
 and Elton John. His melodies are sampled by some of the biggest hip-hop ar
 tists\, including Dr. Dre and Bad Bunny. Filled with unforgettable melodie
 s\, Parisian charm\, nostalgia\, and passion\, FORMIDABLE! AZNAVOUR is a d
 azzling celebration of a true legend . \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.go
 v/node/197471
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197471
END:VEVENT
