SUMMARY:Live-to-Headphones Silent Piano Concert Meditation
LOCATION:Water Works 1710 Highland Ave. Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Experience a musical journey of music  mindfulness this Novemb
 er as MindTravel brings its signature live-piano compositions to Tampa! Mi
 ndTravel Live-to-Headphones: Immersive Piano Concert A mindful music exper
 ience by composer pianist Murray Hidary Slip on wireless headphones and be
  transported by MindTravels signature live-to-headphones silent piano jour
 ney. Composer and pianist Murray Hidary creates an unforgettable evening o
 f soothing\, improvisational music designed to quiet the mind\, open the h
 eart\, and connect you more deeply to yourself and those around you. Event
  Details When: Wednesday\, December 16\, 2026  6:00PM (arrive 2030 minutes
  early for check-in) Where: Water Works Park\, Tampa\, FL (on the grass) T
 ickets: Limited headphones available  reserve yours in advance What Youll 
 Experience A live\, one-of-a-kind piano performance delivered directly thr
 ough premium wireless headphones A mindfulness-infused concert that brings
  you into presence and clarity A shared\, screen-free gathering that foste
 rs expansion\, connection\, and healing Who Its For MindTravel is perfect 
 for: Music lovers and creatives seeking inspiration Wellness and mindfulne
 ss seekers looking to reset Meditators (new or seasoned) ready to deepen t
 heir practice Couples\, friends\, or solo adventurers looking for a unique
  and meaningful night out What to Bring Bring whatever will keep you comfo
 rtable throughout the evening: A blanket\, low chair\, or cushion (seating
  is not provided) A light layer for cooler temperatures Water to stay hydr
 ated An open mind and heart Good to Know Rain or shine. For light rain\, t
 he event continues. In cases of severe weather\, well notify ticket holder
 s by email with updates. Check in early. Headphones are limited and distri
 buted upon arrival. Family-friendly. Guests should be comfortable sitting 
 quietly for the duration. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197186
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197186
END:VEVENT
