SUMMARY:2027 MLK Interfaith Event
LOCATION:4902 N 40th St Tampa \, FL 33610 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join hundreds of neighbors for a stirring tribute to Dr. Marti
 n Luther King\, Jr.\, led by the voices of the Interfaith Choir. Directed 
 by Rev. Isaac Ruffin\, the choir brings together singers from AME\, Baptis
 t\, Methodist\, Jewish\, Bahai\, Seventh Day Adventist\, Episcopal\, and n
 on-denominational congregations to fill the evening with song. The program
  also features messages of hope and unity from community leaders and stude
 nt speakers\, all inspired by Dr. Kings vision of justice\, peace\, and br
 otherhood. The evening closes with food and fellowship\, a favorite time t
 o meet neighbors and strengthen our community. A Tampa Bay tradition since
  1989\, presented with support from Hillsborough County Government and the
  Tampa Urban League. Over 350 people attended in 2026. All are welcome. \n
 \nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197151
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197151
END:VEVENT
