SUMMARY:Book Club: A Land Remembered by Patrick D. Smith
LOCATION:801 Water Street Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Start the new year with the History Centers Book Club on Thurs
 day\, January 21\, 2027\, featuring Patrick D. Smiths beloved Florida nove
 l\, A Land Remembered. This free event will be held from 10:30 to 11:30 a.
 m. at the Tampa Bay History Center\, with the option to join via Zoom . Jo
 hn Nuekamm will serve as the reviewer for this months discussion. Visit th
 e Museum Store to purchase your copy. Grab a cup of coffee and join us mon
 thly for an informal discussion about the best in Florida literature. Topi
 cs range from fiction to food\, poetry to politics. Free with registration
